# Conformance probe pack for `rest` in an item kind (spec 0.21 ruling 27),
# most significant bit first. Public. No message kinds.
#
#   items       an 8-bit count; each item selects a kind by its first byte
#     kind a    when 8 1: a block with an 8-bit length in bytes holding subs
#               to its end (val in 8 bits each), then qty in 8 bits
#     kind b    when 8 2: qty in 8 bits
format     conformance-extents-itemkind
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.items count 8
  kind  a
  when  8  1
  length 8
    group  probe.subs rest
      field  probe.val  8  uint
    end
  end
  field  probe.qty  8  uint
  kind  b
  when  8  2
  field  probe.qty  8  uint
end
